{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21534","headline":"韦居守晚岁常言退休之志因署其居曰大隐洞命予赋诗因赠绝句 · 元稹","name":"韦居守晚岁常言退休之志因署其居曰大隐洞命予赋诗因赠绝句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢公潜有东山意，已向朱门啓洞门。\n大隐犹疑恋朝市，不如名作罢归园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}